# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  SECRETS AND CHAIN STATE — never commit these
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# A node's datadir holds `treasury.key`, which is a PRIVATE KEY, plus the
# local chain and the airdrop claims ledger. Anyone holding that key can
# spend everything the treasury has mined. Chain state is also reproducible
# from the network, so there is no reason to track it.
data/
data-*/
*.key
*.pem
claims.json

# Environment and credentials
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
credentials.json
*.credentials

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Operator-internal notes — not part of the public project
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
HANDOFF*.md
*_BACKUP.*

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Build and tooling noise
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
*.tsbuildinfo
coverage/
.nyc_output/

# Editors and OS
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Local operator tooling and internal analysis — never published.
# ASSESSMENT-* holds company numbers, holdings and business findings.
# scripts-bridge-prep/ writes a throwaway key into out/.
ASSESSMENT-*.md
scripts-bridge-prep/
start-bridge-node.ps1
*.log

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  ⛔⛔ PATENT RESERVATION — NEVER COMMIT, NEVER PUSH
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This repository is PUBLIC. Publishing source is a public disclosure bearing
# on novelty, in every jurisdiction, under any licence - that follows from
# making it public, not from Apache-2.0. Absolute-novelty jurisdictions have
# no grace period, so a push forecloses the filing.
#
# Anything in here is an invention disclosure held back until the operator
# decides the filing position. Moving a file OUT of this directory is a
# deliberate decision to disclose it, not a tidy-up.
patent-private/
